# CanvasKit's WASM, served from public/ so the web dev server can hand it to
# LoadSkiaWeb. It is a byte-for-byte copy of a file in node_modules, so it is
# fetched rather than vendored: run `npm run skia:web` before `npm run web`.
public/canvaskit.wasm
